; expect 2
; A nullary constructor NESTED inside a fieldful pattern. `(Red)` in
; `(Wrap (Red))` used to parse through `parseExpr`, which has no
; pattern context, so it became an ordinary variable - a BINDER that
; matches anything, and the first arm swallowed every scrutinee. This
; answers from the second arm, which is the only arm that matches.
(data Color
  (Red)
  (Green))

(data Item
  (Wrap Color))

(:: main Int)

(fn (main)
  (match (Wrap Green)
    ((Wrap (Red)) 1)
    ((Wrap (Green)) 2)
  )
)
